{
  "id": "p46",
  "title": "Poetry Under a Desert Roof",
  "titleZh": "沙漠屋顶下的诗歌",
  "topic": "沙漠小镇诗歌节与气候",
  "paragraphs": [
    [
      {
        "en": "A small desert town prepares for a yearly poetry night.",
        "zh": "一座小小的沙漠小镇正在筹备一年一度的诗歌之夜。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A national journalist covers the event for a city paper.",
        "zh": "一位全国性的记者为一家城市报纸报道这场活动。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Her channel puts a clear focus on climate and local voices.",
        "zh": "她的频道把明确的焦点放在气候和本地声音上。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The town has seen steady economic growth since last spring.",
        "zh": "自去年春天以来，小镇出现了稳定的经济增长。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Small shops suffer when the local currency falls again.",
        "zh": "当本地货币再次下跌时，小店会受苦。"
      },
      {
        "en": "My cousin's physical work on the bare ground tires the crew.",
        "zh": "我表姐在裸露地面上的体力劳动让工队很累。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A partner group sends a young representative to speak.",
        "zh": "一个合作团体派出一位年轻代表发言。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Visitors observe a local tradition of sharing sweet tea.",
        "zh": "来访者观察到分享甜茶的本地传统。"
      },
      {
        "en": "An evening reading takes place under a wide cloth roof.",
        "zh": "一场晚间朗读在一块宽大的布顶下举行。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A contemporary dance follows the old rhythm and cycle of seasons.",
        "zh": "一支当代舞蹈跟随季节的古老节奏与循环。"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "en": "One actor must overcome a cough and a cigarette smell.",
        "zh": "一位演员必须克服咳嗽和一股香烟味。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Classical music plays while a rugby team warms up.",
        "zh": "古典音乐响起，一支橄榄球队在热身。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A loose string makes the young musician stop and laugh.",
        "zh": "一根松了的弦让年轻乐手停下来大笑。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A bunch of flowers helps her impress the visiting judge.",
        "zh": "一束花帮助她给来访的评委留下印象。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A thorough report offers one clear statistic on rainfall.",
        "zh": "一份详尽的报告给出了一个关于降雨的清楚统计数字。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Then they release a short report on species near the wells.",
        "zh": "然后他们发布了一份关于井边物种的简短报告。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A film commission praises the quiet presence of the dunes.",
        "zh": "一个电影委员会称赞沙丘安静的在场感。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A democratic vote chooses the fashion of the opening parade.",
        "zh": "一次民主投票选出了开幕游行的时装风格。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Her teaching sets a warm tone and raises consciousness.",
        "zh": "她的教学定下温暖的基调，并提升了意识。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Later a licence lets the music run past midnight, changing every perspective.",
        "zh": "后来一张执照让音乐持续到午夜之后，改变了每个人的视角。"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "en": "An advanced recipe adds one secret local ingredient.",
        "zh": "一份高级食谱加入了一种秘密的本地食材。"
      },
      {
        "en": "My father avoids excess and notes a marked drop in waste.",
        "zh": "我父亲避免过度，并注意到浪费明显下降。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A veteran player shows a bloody cut on his arm.",
        "zh": "一位老球员展示手臂上一道流血的伤口。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A coalition of groups tries a new tactic at the well.",
        "zh": "一个团体联盟在井边尝试新策略。"
      },
      {
        "en": "During the final week they seal a water pact and get everyone involved.",
        "zh": "在最后一周，他们缔结了一份用水协议，并让每个人都参与进来。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The millionth visitor certainly receives a warm welcome.",
        "zh": "第一百万位访客当然受到了热烈欢迎。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The programme lists music, food, dance, etc., on frequent posters.",
        "zh": "节目单把音乐、食物、舞蹈等列在频繁出现的海报上。"
      },
      {
        "en": "My uncle will sign a new deal after the bus strike ends.",
        "zh": "我叔叔将在公交罢工结束后签署一项新协议。"
      }
    ]
  ],
